                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.933/162: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peiping</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-10-30T19:00:00+08:00">October 30, 1929—7
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received October 30—11:03 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>938. Department’s 328, October 10, noon. Note dated October 28 was forwarded to
                    Minister for Foreign Affairs by Senior Minister. This note embodies the changes
                    suggested in Department’s instruction mentioned and omits last paragraph of the
                    draft contained in my 856, October 4, 11 a.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">MacMurray</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
